@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:performance] oxlint-allocator-scope
The launcher MUST preload jemalloc only for Oxlint and its child processes. It MUST NOT change
the sandbox's overcommit policy or preload libraries for unrelated commands.

@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:error-handling] oxlint-launcher-failures
The launcher MUST preserve Oxlint's arguments and exit status. A missing allocator library MUST
fail with an error before starting Oxlint.
